id: pm-gh1577
title: "GH-1577: make SDK create focus inheritance explicit and discoverable"
description: Reported programmatic create can inherit a saved interactive focus as parent when the caller omitted parent. Inspect the current public receipt and documented unset-parent opt-out before choosing compatibility-safe SDK defaults or explicit inheritance policy.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: agent-ux,"gh:1577",sdk
created_at: "2026-10-24T16:12:43.896Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-25T06:05:52.472Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-25T06:05:51.827Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-25T06:05:51.329Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "Reproduce public SDK creation in a sandbox with saved focus and explicit/omitted/unset parent controls; Define and document SDK focus inheritance policy without silently changing CLI convenience; Make applied ambient defaults and parent provenance discoverable through types/help/receipt; Verify importer-style Node/Bun consumers and CLI/MCP parity, including templates, tags, assignee and workflow defaults."
parent: pm-9rgaal
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "SDK/MCP create, plan and scheduling use explicit saved-focus opt-in. CLI create/plan and package scheduling retain convenience, including absent or explicitly undefined policy, while honoring false and explicit parent/unset controls. All five strict action schemas, versioned public contracts, full result-field docs and packaged references agree."
expected_result: "Programmatic hierarchy follows explicit caller policy while CLI convenience survives every optional boolean case, and public declarations, result receipts and persisted parents agree."
actual_result: "Independent activated-package regression fails before the calendar default correction and verifies omitted/undefined/false/true persisted parents after it across all three shortcuts. All 111 linked assertions plus documentation links, strict types and complete static pipeline pass; filler inventory decreases by one with the maintained ratchet generator. Prior exact-head hosted source suite passed 11231 tests with 3 skips with exact 100/100/100/100; the new package regression still requires fresh hosted CI/review. All five strict action declarations, generated contracts, explicit create/plan receipts, metadata-only JSON refusal and parent precedence remain covered. Public 2026.10.25 acceptance passed independently for npm/npx/bunx/MCP and npm/Bun agent sessions, but that tag predates this delivery; these changes remain Unreleased."
affected_version: 2026.10.20
